  "agent": "KELLER WILLIAMS REALTY INFINITY",
  "text": "Over $17,000 in lender-qualified downpayment and closing cost assistance WITH NO REPAYMENT available on this professionally renovated Pill Hill home offering 4 beds, 2 baths, and a basement room - perfect for a home office, guest suite, or space to grow into. The expansive kitchen is designed for everyday living and entertaining, featuring 42-inch white shaker cabinetry, quartz countertops, Kohler fixtures, and a full suite of brand-new stainless steel appliances. The fully finished basement extends the home's living space with a dedicated bar niche and a fully equipped laundry room complete with washer, dryer, and custom storage cabinetry. An optional extra refrigerator in the 2-car garage provides convenient overflow storage for groceries and entertaining. Major mechanical updates include a 2025 high-efficiency furnace and central air conditioning system, a brand-new water heater, newer sump pump, brand-new flooring throughout, and new exterior concrete. The roof is believed to be less than 10 years old, according to the previous owner. The location complements the home just as well as the renovations. Within walking distance is the J14 and J15 bus stop, providing convenient public transportation to downtown Chicago and the wider metropolitan area. Nearby Jesse Owens Park offers walking trails, athletic fields, playgrounds, tennis and basketball courts, an outdoor fitness area, and year-round recreational programming. Advocate Trinity Hospital is just minutes away, providing convenient access to one of the area's leading medical facilities. The home is also close to neighborhood schools, shopping, dining, and major expressways. Known for its mature trees, wide streets, and established character, Pill Hill remains one of Chicago's most distinguished South Side neighborhoods. This home pairs extensive modern improvements with an exceptional location, offering comfortable living today and lasting value for years to come.",
